	(text "End switches:\nOmron EE-SX316?_P2\n- ?: 2, 3, 4 -> Mounting spec\n\nRead is high when light (unblocked)\n\nPlug mates with GHR-03\n\nPins:\n- 1: GND\n- 2: Sensor (NPN)\n- 3: Vcc (5V)\n\nUsing jumpers and pins on end switches, we can test\nif two endswitches can be combined into one signal. \n- Only one will ever light at the same time\n- We know which one since we know the direction we just went in\n- This would save 2 pins and give enough pins for xyz stage design"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 151.638 137.922 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "88f5ef8a-6f23-4be9-ac33-10ce7859b5e5")
	)
